cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the HOVSS-PQ research software or accompanying artifacts,
  please cite the Zenodo archive. For exact reproducibility, cite the
  DOI of the specific release you used.
title: >-
  Human-Verifiable Visual Secret Sharing through a Modular Framework
  for Post-Quantum Authentication and Device-Independent Integrity Verification
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rokaya
    given-names: Mahmoud Badee Mahmoud
repository-code: https://github.com/mahmoudrokaya/HOVSS-PQ-
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24351103
url: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24351103
keywords:
  - visual secret sharing
  - visual cryptography
  - integrity verification
  - post-quantum authentication
  - reproducibility
  - optical reconstruction
abstract: >-
  Research software, configurations, and reproducibility artifacts for
  evaluating human-verifiable visual secret sharing, content-integrity
  verification, adversarial attacks, optical reconstruction, and
  post-quantum electronic authentication. Computational and simulated
  evaluations are distinguished from outstanding physical-overlay and
  human-participant validation.
